# ==============================================================================
# WARENGINE API - Master Test Suite
# Requiere: REST Client (extensión VS Code)
# Servidor: http://localhost:8017  (deno task dev-api)
#
# ARCHIVOS DE PRUEBA POR MÓDULO:
#   http/01-autenticacion.http  — Login, renovar token, logout, verificar
#   http/02-sucursales.http     — CRUD de sucursales (RF-ADM-C1, C2, C3)
#   http/03-usuarios.http       — Gestión de usuarios (RF-ADM-C5, C6, C7, C8)
#
# ESTADO DE ENDPOINTS (probado 2026-10-05):
#   ✅ POST   /auth/login
#   ✅ POST   /auth/renovar-token
#   ✅ GET    /auth/verificar
#   ✅ POST   /auth/logout
#   ✅ GET    /health
#   ✅ GET    /administracion/sucursales
#   ✅ POST   /administracion/sucursales
#   ✅ PUT    /administracion/sucursales/:id
#   ✅ GET    /administracion/usuarios
#   ✅ GET    /administracion/usuarios?rolId=&sucursalId=
#   ✅ POST   /administracion/usuarios
#   ✅ PUT    /administracion/usuarios/:id/rol
#   ✅ PUT    /administracion/usuarios/:id/estado
# ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8017

# ==============================================================================
# INICIO RÁPIDO — Login + pruebas básicas en un solo archivo
# Para pruebas completas, abre los archivos en http/
# ==============================================================================

### 1. Login Superadmin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@warengine.local",
  "password": "Warengine.Admin.2026!"
}

###

### 2. Renovar Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/renovar-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

###

### 3. Verificar Sesión
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verificar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###

### 4. Cerrar Sesión
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###

### 5. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

# ==============================================================================
# MÓDULO ADMINISTRACIÓN - SUCURSALES
# ==============================================================================

### 6. Listar Sucursales (RF-ADM-C1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/administracion/sucursales
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###

### 7. Crear Sucursal (RF-ADM-C2)
# @name crearSucursal
POST {{baseUrl}}/administracion/sucursales
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Sucursal Norte",
  "direccion": "Calle 170 # 15-20, Bogotá",
  "contacto": "+57 300 1234567"
}

###

### 8. Editar Sucursal (RF-ADM-C3)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/administracion/sucursales/{{crearSucursal.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Sucursal Principal Central",
  "direccion": "Cra 7 # 72-10, Bogotá",
  "contacto": "admin@warengine.local",
  "isActive": true
}

###

# ==============================================================================
# MÓDULO ADMINISTRACIÓN - USUARIOS
# ==============================================================================

### 9. Listar Usuarios (RF-ADM-C5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/administracion/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###

### 10. Listar Usuarios con Filtro por Rol (RF-ADM-C5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/administracion/usuarios?rolId=2&sucursalId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

###

### 11. Crear Usuario + Empleado Atómico (RF-ADM-C6)
# @name crearUsuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/administracion/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Pérez",
  "tipoDocumento": "CC",
  "numeroDocumento": "1020304050",
  "email": "juan.perez@warengine.local",
  "password": "Password.2026!",
  "rolId": 2,
  "sucursalId": 1,
  "cargo": "Administrador de Sucursal"
}

###

### 12. Cambiar Rol de Usuario (RF-ADM-C7)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/administracion/usuarios/{{crearUsuario.response.body.id}}/rol
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rolId": 3
}

###

### 13. Cambiar Estado de Usuario - Desactivar (RF-ADM-C8)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/administracion/usuarios/{{crearUsuario.response.body.id}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

###

### 14. Cambiar Estado de Usuario - Reactivar (RF-ADM-C8)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/administracion/usuarios/{{crearUsuario.response.body.id}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 15. Regla de Negocio: Intentar desactivar Super Admin (debe retornar 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/administracion/usuarios/{{login.response.body.usuario.id}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

###